Z||000016||Slammed Fiero||03-19-2001||10:43 AM||||The Tires are Kumoho ecsta supra 712's. She ordered the rims and tires through a friend of mine. The tires are the same as we run on our Vette for street. They have a good wet weather pattern and work quite well at autocrosses. Their also cheap for 17's<P>205/45/17 front<BR>235/45/17 rear. Gives the car a nice rake.<BR>The rims are 5Ziegen Imperios<P>JM||||reg||1
